    "signatureNotes": [
      "[ability] Umbral Surge:\nWhen Tapu Hina enters the field, if a terrain exists, it will be destroyed.\nTapu Hina will receive a one-stage increase in a stat depending on the destroyed terrain:\n- Electric Terrain: +1 Speed\n- Psychic Terrain: +1 Special Attack\n- Misty Terrain: +1 Special Defense\n- Grassy Terrain: +1 Defense\n- Corrosive Terrain: +1 Attack\nThe stat increase can only happen once during a battle. Entering the field a second time will still destroy the terrain but not increase a stat."
    ],
